                                                   623 ***********************************************************************
                                                   624 *     Macros to help build test tables
                                                   625 ***********************************************************************



                                                   627 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   628 * TSTPLO : test whether a PLO function is available/installed.
                                                   629 *          If a functionm is installed, CC=0. Not installed, CC=3.
                                                   630 *          - &fun: the function number
                                                   631 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   632          MACRO
                                                   633          TSTPLO  &FUN
                                                   634          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   635 &TNUM    SETA  &TNUM+1
                                                   636 *
                                                   637 * test if PLO function is available
                                                   638 *
                                                   639          USING *,R5                base for test data and test routine
                                                   640          USING PLOAVAL,R5
                                                   641
                                                   642 T&TNUM   DC    A(CODE&TNUM)           address of test routine
                                                   643          DC    H'&TNUM'            test number
                                                   644          DC    X'00'
                                                   645          DC    HL1'&FUN'           Function Number
                                                   646 *
                                                   647 CODE&TNUM DS    0F
                                                   648          LA    R1,(256+&FUN)       T bit 55  (+256)
                                                   649          LR    R0,R1
                                                   650          PLO   0,0,0,0
                                                   651          BZ    0(R11)              Function is installed, return
                                                   652
                                                   653          BAL   R15,NAMSG           Function not available message
                                                   654          BR    R11                 return
                                                   655          DROP  R5
                                                   656 *
                                                   657          MEND
                                                   658
                                                   659 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   660 * TSTLBL : insert a label with a test number suffix
                                                   661 *          - &name: the label name
                                                   662 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   663          MACRO
                                                   664          TSTLBL  &NAME
                                                   665          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   666          LCLC  &X
                                                   667 &X       SETC  '&NAME&TNUM'
                                                   668 &X       DS  0C
                                                   669          MEND
ASMA Ver. 0.7.0  plo-01-extension                                                                   14 Oct 2026 00:12:13  Page    19

  LOC        OBJECT CODE       ADDR1     ADDR2    STMT

                                                   671 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   672 * TSTEND : end a test
                                                   673 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   674          MACRO
                                                   675          TSTEND  &NAME
                                                   676          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   677          DS    0H
                                                   678          DC    CL32'End of test: &TNUM'
                                                   679          MEND
                                                   680
                                                   681 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   682 * TSTCODE : The code for the test follows the label
                                                   683 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   684          MACRO
                                                   685          TSTCODE  &NAME
                                                   686          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   687          LCLC  &X
                                                   688 &X       SETC  'CODE&TNUM'
                                                   689 &X       DS    0F
                                                   690          MEND
                                                   691
                                                   692 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   693 * TSTDATA: The data for the test follows.
                                                   694 *          Data is aligned to the 1K boundary after the TSTHDR
                                                   695 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   696          MACRO
                                                   697          TSTDATA  &NAME
                                                   698          GBLA  &THDRNUM
                                                   699          ORG   PLOETST+(200*K)+(&THDRNUM*4*K)+K
                                                   700          MEND
ASMA Ver. 0.7.0  plo-01-extension                                                                   14 Oct 2026 00:12:13  Page    20

