                                                   702 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   703 * TSTHDR: The start of a PLOE Test
                                                   704 *         Test is aligned to 4K boundary starting at 200K
                                                   705 *              1 K - test constants plus code
                                                   706 *              3 K - test data area
                                                   707 *
                                                   708 *        Note: PLOETEST DSECT needs to be in-sync with TSTHDR
                                                   709 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                   710          MACRO
                                                   711          TSTHDR  &CC,&UR,&FUN
                                                   712 .*                      &CC    - expected CC
                                                   713 .*                      &UR    - expected unequal results
                                                   714 .*                      &FUN   - function
                                                   715
                                                   716          LCLA  &XCC(4)  &CC has mask values for FAILED condition codes
                                                   717 &XCC(1)  SETA  7                   CC != 0
                                                   718 &XCC(2)  SETA  11                  CC != 1
                                                   719 &XCC(3)  SETA  13                  CC != 2
                                                   720 &XCC(4)  SETA  14                  CC != 3
                                                   721
                                                   722          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                   723 &TNUM    SETA  &TNUM+1
                                                   724
                                                   725          GBLA  &THDRNUM
                                                   726 &THDRNUM SETA  &THDRNUM+1
                                                   727
                                                   728          ORG   PLOETST+(200*K)+(&THDRNUM*4*K)
                                                   729          DC    CL32'START of test: &TNUM'
                                                   730
                                                   731          USING *,R5                base for test data and test routine
                                                   732          USING PLOETEST,R5
                                                   733
                                                   734 T&TNUM   DC    A(CODE&TNUM)        address of test code
                                                   735          DC    H'&TNUM'            test number
                                                   736          DC    X'00'
                                                   737          DC    HL1'&FUN'           Function
                                                   738          DC    HL1'&UR'            expected unequal results (UR)
                                                   739          DC    HL1'00'             found UR
                                                   740
                                                   741          DC    HL1'&CC'            cc
                                                   742          AIF   ('&CC' EQ '99').NOCC
                                                   743          DC    HL1'&XCC(&CC+1)'    not expected CC mask
                                                   744          AGO   .CCCONT
                                                   745 .NOCC    ANOP
                                                   746          DC    HL1'00'             cc not checked
                                                   747 .CCCONT  ANOP
                                                   748
                                                   749          DS    X                   extracted cc
                                                   750          DS    2F                  extract PSW after test (has CC)
                                                   751          DC    A(FMSG&TNUM)        address of test fail message
                                                   752          DC    A(OPSRC&TNUM)       address of operand source
                                                   753          DC    A(OPDST&TNUM)       address of operand destination
                                                   754          DC    A(PL&TNUM)          address of parameter list
                                                   755          DC    A(RANDX+&TNUM)      address of random source data
                                                   756 .*
                                                   757          MEND
ASMA Ver. 0.7.0  plo-01-extension                                                                   14 Oct 2026 00:12:13  Page    21

